<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3353"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 03, 2005 - 10:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Jujuree - if your browser doesn&#39;t show the image on the entrance page to the site, just take a look at: <a href="http://catchbtk.com/images/petratina.gif" target=_top>http://catchbtk.com/images/petratina.gif</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
