<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3354"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 03, 2005 - 10:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->juj- like i said, it&#39;s at /index.html &#40;ie. <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/index.html" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/index.html</a> &#41; <BR> <BR>tom- can you comment on whether there is any secondary BTK to &#34;pet rat&#34; connection in evidence?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
